# Place the prebuilt agent binary here before building the Docker image.
# It is baked into the image and seeded into the data volume on every
# container start, so a fresh install ships with a working agent.
#
# Expected file (copy from your build machine):
#   efficient_log_forwarder.exe   (from build/Release/)
#
# The exe is statically linked (/MT); no VC++ runtime DLLs are needed.
# The exe itself is ignored by git. If this folder is empty, the image
# builds fine but GET /agent/binary returns 404 and the install script
# cannot run; rebuild the image with the exe staged.
